  "historyNote": "#7094, eff 9-15-99; ss by #8898, eff 9-15-07; ss by #10987, eff 12-3-15; ss by #14530, eff 3-4-26, EXPIRES: 3-4-36",
  "inScheme": "https://granitestate.github.io/rules/scheme",
